WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:03.203
It's been nearly 13 months since Russia

00:00:03.670 --> 00:00:06.106
invaded the sovereign nation of Ukraine.

00:00:07.073 --> 00:00:09.843
Ukraine has been independent since 1991

00:00:10.543 --> 00:00:11.544
and has presented

00:00:11.544 --> 00:00:14.381
no threat whatsoever to Russia.

00:00:15.382 --> 00:00:16.783
Russia launched

00:00:16.783 --> 00:00:19.152
and has continued for over a year now.

00:00:19.152 --> 00:00:21.821
A war of aggression and flagrant

00:00:21.821 --> 00:00:24.090
violation of international law.

00:00:24.858 --> 00:00:27.093
This is and remains

00:00:27.394 --> 00:00:29.496
a Russian frontal assault

00:00:29.496 --> 00:00:31.731
on the rules based international order

00:00:31.731 --> 00:00:34.300
that has been in place for 80 years,

00:00:34.801 --> 00:00:36.069
eight decades

00:00:36.069 --> 00:00:38.104
since the end of World War Two

00:00:38.938 --> 00:00:41.141
and the face of this act of aggression

00:00:41.141 --> 00:00:43.076
in a war of conquest.

00:00:43.076 --> 00:00:45.311
This group remains unified.

00:00:45.311 --> 00:00:46.780
NATO's united.

00:00:46.780 --> 00:00:49.049
The people of Ukraine are unyielding.

00:00:49.049 --> 00:00:49.682
They are standing

00:00:49.682 --> 00:00:51.584
steadfast in the face

00:00:51.584 --> 00:00:53.753
of the Russian onslaught.

00:00:54.154 --> 00:00:56.589
Russia remains isolated.

00:00:56.589 --> 00:00:57.690
Their military stocks

00:00:57.690 --> 00:00:59.526
are rapidly depleting.

00:00:59.526 --> 00:01:01.995
The soldiers are demoralized, untrained,

00:01:02.495 --> 00:01:05.198
unmotivated conscripts and convicts,

00:01:05.198 --> 00:01:06.933
and their leadership is failing them.

00:01:08.034 --> 00:01:08.935
Having already failed

00:01:08.935 --> 00:01:10.804
in their strategic objectives.

00:01:10.804 --> 00:01:13.006
Russia is increasingly relying

00:01:13.006 --> 00:01:14.040
on other countries,

00:01:14.040 --> 00:01:15.875
such as Iran and North Korea,

00:01:15.875 --> 00:01:17.610
as the Secretary pointed out.

00:01:17.610 --> 00:01:19.045
They are using Iranian drones

00:01:19.045 --> 00:01:20.547
to continue to terrorize

00:01:20.547 --> 00:01:22.482
Ukrainian civilians.

00:01:22.482 --> 00:01:24.417
This relationship is built

00:01:24.417 --> 00:01:26.853
on the cruel bonds of oppressing freedom,

00:01:27.287 --> 00:01:28.988
subverting liberty,

00:01:28.988 --> 00:01:31.024
and maintaining their tyranny.

00:01:31.024 --> 00:01:31.491
Yet free

00:01:31.491 --> 00:01:33.626
people will not return

00:01:33.626 --> 00:01:35.628
to the shackles of tyranny.

00:01:35.628 --> 00:01:37.664
Ukrainians remain defiant

00:01:37.664 --> 00:01:38.731
still in their spines

00:01:38.731 --> 00:01:40.300
and courage in their veins,

00:01:40.300 --> 00:01:41.968
and they have the broad support

00:01:41.968 --> 00:01:43.203
of the United States

00:01:43.203 --> 00:01:45.405
and the international community.

00:01:45.405 --> 00:01:47.841
The battle of park mode continues.

00:01:47.841 --> 00:01:50.043
But Ukraine is fighting the valor

00:01:50.043 --> 00:01:51.211
with robust defenses.

00:01:51.211 --> 00:01:52.412
Ukraine has fixed

00:01:52.412 --> 00:01:54.714
the Russian forces at that city,

00:01:54.714 --> 00:01:55.548
and they're exacting

00:01:55.548 --> 00:01:57.750
very heavy costs on the border group

00:01:57.750 --> 00:01:59.919
and the Russian regular military.

00:01:59.919 --> 00:02:01.955
Ukraine remains strong.

00:02:01.955 --> 00:02:04.357
There are capable and trained Ukrainian

00:02:04.357 --> 00:02:05.225
soldiers,

00:02:05.225 --> 00:02:07.560
a strength strong in their combat units.

00:02:07.560 --> 00:02:08.161
Their tanks,

00:02:08.161 --> 00:02:09.529
infantry fighting vehicles

00:02:09.529 --> 00:02:10.797
and armored vehicles

00:02:10.797 --> 00:02:12.832
are only going to bolster the front line.

00:02:13.800 --> 00:02:15.435
Ukrainian precision munitions continue

00:02:15.435 --> 00:02:17.337
to target the logistics

00:02:17.337 --> 00:02:19.506
and communications systems of Russia.

00:02:20.607 --> 00:02:21.474
Lacking

00:02:21.474 --> 00:02:22.408
effective small unit

00:02:22.408 --> 00:02:24.644
leaders and absent the proper equipment.

00:02:25.245 --> 00:02:27.680
This is a grinding attrition warfare

00:02:28.548 --> 00:02:31.584
that Russia is trying to execute.

00:02:31.584 --> 00:02:34.020
Wave after wave of Russian soldiers

00:02:34.020 --> 00:02:36.055
are thrown into the chaos of war.

00:02:36.055 --> 00:02:36.489
Absent

00:02:36.489 --> 00:02:38.558
any sort of synchronized coordination

00:02:38.558 --> 00:02:39.959
and direction,

00:02:40.193 --> 00:02:41.861
Russia continues to pay severely

00:02:41.861 --> 00:02:43.830
in terms of lives and military equipment

00:02:43.830 --> 00:02:46.099
for its continued war of choice.

00:02:46.099 --> 00:02:46.633
Right now

00:02:46.633 --> 00:02:49.002
there is intense fighting in and around.

00:02:49.002 --> 00:02:51.004
And the Russians are making small

00:02:51.004 --> 00:02:53.473
tactical advances, but at great cost.

00:02:54.107 --> 00:02:55.141
Elsewhere, the front line

00:02:55.141 --> 00:02:56.709
remains relatively static

00:02:56.709 --> 00:02:58.912
with significant exchanges of artillery,

00:02:58.912 --> 00:03:00.480
but no significant maneuver gains

00:03:00.480 --> 00:03:01.981
by either side.

00:03:02.182 --> 00:03:03.082
Right now,

00:03:03.082 --> 00:03:04.217
as you know,

00:03:04.217 --> 00:03:05.385
there is a significant ongoing

00:03:05.385 --> 00:03:06.119
effort to build up

00:03:06.119 --> 00:03:07.420
the Ukrainian military

00:03:07.420 --> 00:03:09.055
in terms of equipment, munitions

00:03:09.055 --> 00:03:09.989
and training

00:03:09.989 --> 00:03:11.057
in a variety of countries

00:03:11.057 --> 00:03:12.192
in order to enable

00:03:12.192 --> 00:03:14.360
Ukraine to defend itself.

00:03:14.360 --> 00:03:16.763
The increased Ukrainian capability

00:03:16.763 --> 00:03:18.164
will allow the Ukrainian leadership

00:03:18.164 --> 00:03:19.532
to develop and execute

00:03:19.532 --> 00:03:21.834
a variety of options in the future

00:03:21.834 --> 00:03:23.269
to achieve their objectives

00:03:23.269 --> 00:03:24.470
and bring this war

00:03:24.470 --> 00:03:26.606
to a successful conclusion.

00:03:26.606 --> 00:03:28.608
This is an act of brutal aggression

00:03:28.608 --> 00:03:30.009
by President Putin

00:03:30.009 --> 00:03:31.444
and the Russian military

00:03:31.444 --> 00:03:33.813
with complete disregard for human life,

00:03:34.080 --> 00:03:36.282
both civilian and military

00:03:36.282 --> 00:03:37.517
The Russians are

00:03:37.517 --> 00:03:39.152
wantonly killing civilians

00:03:39.152 --> 00:03:40.053
in large attacks

00:03:40.053 --> 00:03:41.955
on civilian infrastructure,

00:03:41.955 --> 00:03:44.490
in densely populated urban areas,

00:03:44.490 --> 00:03:45.725
severely undertrained

00:03:45.725 --> 00:03:46.259
poorly led,

00:03:46.259 --> 00:03:46.793
poorly equipped

00:03:46.793 --> 00:03:47.860
Russian forces

00:03:47.860 --> 00:03:49.929
are conducting mindless frontal attacks

00:03:50.196 --> 00:03:51.965
and sacrificing hundreds per day.

00:03:52.932 --> 00:03:53.433
The political

00:03:53.433 --> 00:03:55.568
objectives that Putin intended to achieve

00:03:55.568 --> 00:03:57.704
384 days ago

00:03:57.704 --> 00:03:58.805
are obvious to the world,

00:03:58.805 --> 00:03:59.572
and it should be obvious

00:03:59.572 --> 00:04:01.140
to Putin that these objectives

00:04:01.140 --> 00:04:02.809
are no longer achievable

00:04:02.809 --> 00:04:04.611
by continuing this war.

00:04:04.611 --> 00:04:06.079
And Putin can end this war,

00:04:06.079 --> 00:04:07.413
and he can end it today,

00:04:07.413 --> 00:04:09.249
and he needs to do so.

00:04:09.249 --> 00:04:11.684
Free people are not easily conquered.

00:04:12.218 --> 00:04:14.487
And the Ukrainian people are free.

00:04:14.487 --> 00:04:15.655
And they will never give up

00:04:15.655 --> 00:04:17.924
in their fight to stay free.

00:04:17.924 --> 00:04:19.259
Two weeks ago,

00:04:19.259 --> 00:04:20.260
the United States released

00:04:20.260 --> 00:04:22.195
another security assistance package,

00:04:22.195 --> 00:04:24.464
which included high Mars ammunition.

00:04:24.464 --> 00:04:25.798
Artillery,

00:04:25.898 --> 00:04:29.035
vehicle maintenance and vehicles.

00:04:29.035 --> 00:04:30.370
The nine countries have pledged over

00:04:30.370 --> 00:04:32.572
150 leopard tanks, for example.

00:04:33.239 --> 00:04:33.706
This group

00:04:33.706 --> 00:04:34.941
that met today is providing

00:04:34.941 --> 00:04:37.343
air defense, artillery,

00:04:37.343 --> 00:04:39.312
regular artillery, rocket, artillery,

00:04:39.312 --> 00:04:40.813
armor, ammunition.

00:04:40.813 --> 00:04:42.148
And that will be critical

00:04:42.148 --> 00:04:43.049
to Ukraine's ability

00:04:43.049 --> 00:04:44.651
to continue the fight

00:04:44.651 --> 00:04:45.618
A broad mix of air

00:04:45.618 --> 00:04:47.720
defense systems have been promised,

00:04:47.720 --> 00:04:49.489
and they will protect the skies of Kiev

00:04:49.489 --> 00:04:51.858
and the free cities of Ukraine.

00:04:51.858 --> 00:04:52.725
Artillery and armor

00:04:52.725 --> 00:04:54.360
are going to strengthen Ukraine lines

00:04:54.360 --> 00:04:55.261
enable their forces

00:04:55.261 --> 00:04:56.763
to synchronize fire and movement

00:04:56.763 --> 00:04:57.630
for either offensive

00:04:57.630 --> 00:04:59.365
or defensive operations.

00:04:59.365 --> 00:05:01.234
Long range fires will challenge

00:05:01.234 --> 00:05:02.969
Russia's ability to command and control,

00:05:02.969 --> 00:05:05.071
protect and sustain their forces.

00:05:05.071 --> 00:05:06.072
The Ukrainian soldiers

00:05:06.072 --> 00:05:06.873
wear the blue

00:05:06.873 --> 00:05:09.075
and yellow of the Ukrainian flag.

00:05:09.075 --> 00:05:11.010
But the colors of 50 other nations

00:05:11.010 --> 00:05:12.211
that met today

00:05:12.211 --> 00:05:13.346
stand beside Ukraine

00:05:13.346 --> 00:05:14.881
to support the principles

00:05:14.881 --> 00:05:17.250
of the rules based international order.

00:05:17.250 --> 00:05:19.352
A system in place to prevent aggression

00:05:19.352 --> 00:05:21.421
and uphold the values of liberty

00:05:21.421 --> 00:05:22.855
and sovereignty.

00:05:22.855 --> 00:05:25.124
That system is what preserves the peace

00:05:25.124 --> 00:05:26.359
and provides benefits

00:05:26.359 --> 00:05:27.727
throughout the globe.

00:05:27.727 --> 00:05:29.162
As President Biden,

00:05:29.162 --> 00:05:29.896
Secretary Austin

00:05:29.896 --> 00:05:30.830
and many others

00:05:30.830 --> 00:05:31.230
to include

00:05:31.230 --> 00:05:32.131
all the leaders of Europe

00:05:32.131 --> 00:05:33.633
have said many times

00:05:33.633 --> 00:05:34.434
that we will remain

00:05:34.434 --> 00:05:36.402
committed for as long as it takes.

00:05:36.402 --> 00:05:36.803
Thank you,

00:05:36.803 --> 00:05:38.371
and I look forward to your questions.

00:05:38.371 --> 00:05:39.138
Thank you, gentlemen.

00:05:39.138 --> 00:05:40.773
First question, go to lead a Boulder

00:05:40.773 --> 00:05:43.443
Associated Press. Thank you.

00:05:43.443 --> 00:05:44.577
Um, Mr.

00:05:44.577 --> 00:05:45.345
Secretary,

00:05:45.345 --> 00:05:47.180
you said you spoke with your counterpart.

00:05:47.180 --> 00:05:48.915
Can you give us a sense of

00:05:48.915 --> 00:05:51.584
the Russian's reaction to the call?

00:05:52.251 --> 00:05:54.354
Did they suggest to you

00:05:54.354 --> 00:05:57.256
their defense that this was an accident

00:05:57.590 --> 00:06:00.293
or intentional or that it never happened?

00:06:00.927 --> 00:06:02.161
Can you just give us a better

00:06:02.161 --> 00:06:03.329
readout of your call?

00:06:03.329 --> 00:06:04.130
And, General Milley,

00:06:04.130 --> 00:06:05.264
have you spoken

00:06:05.264 --> 00:06:06.499
to your counterpart

00:06:06.499 --> 00:06:08.701
or are you intending to do so?

00:06:08.701 --> 00:06:10.970
And do you believe

00:06:10.970 --> 00:06:12.238
after what you've seen

00:06:12.238 --> 00:06:14.207
that this was intentional?

00:06:14.207 --> 00:06:15.975
Is this considered an act of war?

00:06:19.045 --> 00:06:20.146
Thanks for the question, Leader.

00:06:20.146 --> 00:06:20.346
Leader,

00:06:22.382 --> 00:06:24.550
I won't speak for Minister Shoigu,

00:06:25.351 --> 00:06:26.652
nor will

00:06:26.652 --> 00:06:28.821
I get into the details of our discussion.

00:06:29.722 --> 00:06:31.891
I'll just reiterate that

00:06:31.891 --> 00:06:35.027
the United States will fly and operate

00:06:35.628 --> 00:06:38.131
wherever international law allows.

00:06:39.365 --> 00:06:43.202
Now we take any potential for escalation

00:06:43.202 --> 00:06:44.070
very seriously.

00:06:44.070 --> 00:06:45.605
And that's why

00:06:45.605 --> 00:06:46.672
I believe it's important

00:06:46.672 --> 00:06:49.675
to keep the lines of communication open.

00:06:49.675 --> 00:06:51.944
I think it's really key that

00:06:51.944 --> 00:06:52.979
that we're able

00:06:52.979 --> 00:06:53.846
to pick up the phone

00:06:53.846 --> 00:06:55.748
and engage each other.

00:06:55.848 --> 00:06:58.584
And I think that that will help to

00:06:59.252 --> 00:07:00.720
prevent miscalculation.

00:07:00.720 --> 00:07:02.488
Going forward.

00:07:03.556 --> 00:07:05.391
So, Leader, thanks for the question

00:07:05.391 --> 00:07:06.959
on the intentionality.

00:07:06.959 --> 00:07:07.527
Don't know.

00:07:07.527 --> 00:07:10.396
I do plan to talk to my counterpart,

00:07:10.396 --> 00:07:11.531
General Gerasimov.

00:07:11.531 --> 00:07:12.565
We have a scheduled call.

00:07:12.565 --> 00:07:14.400
We'll see if that works out.

00:07:14.534 --> 00:07:16.702
So was that intentional or not?

00:07:16.869 --> 00:07:17.804
I don't know yet.

00:07:17.804 --> 00:07:18.304
We know that

00:07:18.304 --> 00:07:20.273
The Intercept was intentional.

00:07:20.273 --> 00:07:20.907
We know that

00:07:20.907 --> 00:07:22.275
the aggressive behavior was intentional.

00:07:22.275 --> 00:07:23.576
We also know it was very unprofessional

00:07:23.576 --> 00:07:25.011
and very unsafe.

00:07:25.044 --> 00:07:27.447
The actual contact of the fixed wing

00:07:28.614 --> 00:07:29.715
Russian fighter

00:07:29.715 --> 00:07:31.217
with our UAV,

00:07:31.217 --> 00:07:33.119
the physical contact of those two,

00:07:33.119 --> 00:07:35.755
not sure yet. That remains to be seen.

00:07:35.755 --> 00:07:37.123
But I can't

00:07:37.323 --> 00:07:37.790
I can tell you

00:07:37.790 --> 00:07:38.691
with certainty, though,

00:07:38.691 --> 00:07:40.159
that we have absolute

00:07:40.159 --> 00:07:41.794
evidence of the contact,

00:07:41.794 --> 00:07:42.595
the intercepts etc.

00:07:42.595 --> 00:07:43.896
and it's very aggressive.

00:07:43.896 --> 00:07:44.430
You've heard

00:07:44.430 --> 00:07:45.298
about the dumping of the fuel

00:07:45.298 --> 00:07:45.798
and everything else.

00:07:45.798 --> 00:07:46.933
We have video evidence of all that.

00:07:46.933 --> 00:07:48.968
So there's there's no question

00:07:48.968 --> 00:07:50.169
that that part of its intention

00:07:50.169 --> 00:07:51.337
of the actual physical contact

00:07:51.337 --> 00:07:53.372
of the aircraft that I'm not so sure.

00:07:53.773 --> 00:07:54.907
So we'll have to figure that out,

00:07:54.907 --> 00:07:55.575
that we're not

00:07:55.575 --> 00:07:57.076
we're not positive of that yet.

00:07:57.076 --> 00:07:58.311
As far as an act of war goes,

00:07:58.311 --> 00:07:59.178
I'm not going to

00:07:59.178 --> 00:07:59.946
I'm not going to go there.

00:07:59.946 --> 00:08:02.982
Incidents happen and and clearly

00:08:03.316 --> 00:08:05.852
we do not seek armed conflict with

00:08:06.152 --> 00:08:07.053
with Russia.

00:08:07.053 --> 00:08:08.955
And and I believe that

00:08:09.989 --> 00:08:10.389
at this

00:08:10.389 --> 00:08:12.725
point we should investigate this incident

00:08:12.725 --> 00:08:13.526
and move on from there.

00:08:13.526 --> 00:08:14.861
But we will continue to exercise

00:08:14.861 --> 00:08:16.195
our rights in international airspace.

